deepml motion 0.3
module corpus.deepml_motion.example_01305
policy deterministic
policy no_network
skeleton Rig01305 { joint Root parent none joint Hip parent Root joint Knee parent Hip joint Foot parent Knee }
blend_tree Locomotion01305 parameter speed { idle at 0 walk at 1 run at 3 }
mask LowerBody { include [Hip, Knee, Foot] }
ik FootIK01305 chain [Hip, Knee, Foot] target GroundTarget iterations 9
retarget SourceRig3 -> Rig01305 map { Hips: Hip LeftFoot: Foot }
state_machine Move01305 { Idle -> Walk when speed > 0.1 Walk -> Run when speed > 2.0 Run -> Idle when speed == 0 }
root_motion from Root axes [x,z]
verify motion_hash == "invalid-01305"
